    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 708.7pt; border-collapse: collapse; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" border=\"0\" width=\"945\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid; height: 3.5pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 134.2pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; mso-background-themecolor: text2; mso-background-themetint: 102; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 3.5pt;\" width=\"179\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"page-break-after: avoid;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Diagnostic category</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 105.1pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; mso-background-themecolor: text2; mso-background-themetint: 102; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 3.5pt;\" width=\"140\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center; page-break-after: avoid;\" align=\"center\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Estimated <span style=\"mso-no-proof: yes;\">ROM<sup>a</sup></span></span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 469.4pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; mso-background-themecolor: text2; mso-background-themetint: 102; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 3.5pt;\" width=\"626\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"page-break-after: avoid;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Diagnostic management <span style=\"mso-no-proof: yes;\">options</span></span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 134.2pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"179\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Insufficient/Inadequate/​Non-diagnostic</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 105.1pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"140\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">30% (9&ndash;42%)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 469.4pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"626\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-no-proof: yes;\">CORRELATE.</span> Repeat FNAB, preferably with ROSE.</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 134.2pt; background: #DAEEF3; mso-background-themecolor: accent5; mso-background-themetint: 51; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"179\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Benign</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 105.1pt; background: #DAEEF3; mso-background-themecolor: accent5; mso-background-themetint: 51; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"140\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">2% (0&ndash;4%)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 469.4pt; background: #DAEEF3; mso-background-themecolor: accent5; mso-background-themetint: 51; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"626\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext; mso-no-proof: yes;\">CORRELATE. </span><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">If discrepancy, repeat FNAB and/or CNB. If correlation, review when appropriate. </span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 134.2pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"179\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Atypical</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 105.1pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"140\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">40% (46%)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 469.4pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"626\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-no-proof: yes;\">CORRELATE.</span> Discuss at MDTM. Repeat FNAB and/or CNB and/or surgical biopsy.</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 4; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 134.2pt; background: #DAEEF3; mso-background-themecolor: accent5; mso-background-themetint: 51; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"179\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">STNUMP</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 105.1pt; background: #DAEEF3; mso-background-themecolor: accent5; mso-background-themetint: 51; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"140\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">51% (20&ndash;27%)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 469.4pt; background: #DAEEF3; mso-background-themecolor: accent5; mso-background-themetint: 51; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"626\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext; mso-no-proof: yes;\">CORRELATE.</span><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\"> Discuss at MDTM. Repeat FNAB and/or CNB and/or surgical biopsy.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 5; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 134.2pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"179\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Suspicious for malignancy</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 105.1pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"140\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">68% (71&ndash;80%)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 469.4pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"626\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">CORRELATE. Discuss at MDTM. Consider repeat FNAB to gain material for ancillary testing, but will usually require CNB and/or surgical biopsy.</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 6; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 134.2pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; mso-background-themecolor: accent5; mso-background-themetint: 51; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"179\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Malignant</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 105.1pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; mso-background-themecolor: accent5; mso-background-themetint: 51; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"140\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">98% (91&ndash;100%)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 469.4pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; mso-background-themecolor: accent5; mso-background-themetint: 51; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"626\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">CORRELATE. Discuss at MDTM. Will usually require CNB and/or surgical biopsy.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">CORRELATE, correlate with clinical and imaging findings, and where available with cell block, ICC, FISH, PCR, and NGS findings; MDTM, multidisciplinary team meeting; STNUMP, &ldquo;Soft tissue neoplasm of uncertain malignant potential&rdquo;.</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><sup><span style=\"mso-no-proof: yes;\">a</span></sup><span style=\"mso-no-proof: yes;\">Estimated ROMs</span> <span style=\"mso-no-proof: yes;\">are based on a large retrospective study using the WHO System categories, including the &ldquo;STNUMP&rdquo; category, and on a series of other retrospective studies in brackets </span><span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{32926591; 12451566; 20091838; 28739192; 19763717; 11190808}</span><span style=\"mso-no-proof: yes;\">.</span></p>",
